   <dc:subject>http://aims.fao.org/aos/agrovoc/c_1fc62594</dc:subject>
   <dc:subject>http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85052332</dc:subject>
   <dc:description>ABSTRACT: The extended beta type 1 distribution has the probability density function proportional to x α−1 (1 − x) β−1 exp[−σ/x(1 − x)], 0 &lt; x &lt; 1. In this article, we derive the Fisher information matrix and entropies such as R´enyi and Shannon for the extended beta type 1 distribution.</dc:description>
